  abilityId: 2810558
  abilityName: Holocaust Explosion
  abilityDesc: 25 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    fills BB gauge for 4 turns, boosts all elemental damage for 3 turns, fully restores
    HP for 4 turns, boosts Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 4 turns & fills OD
    gauge
